OL,3,GNEWSAOverturned lorry shuts A453 near
OL,4,Aairport
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn overturned lorry has led to
OL,7,F"significant disruption" on the A453
OL,8,Fnear East Midlands Airport.
OL,10,FEmergency services were at the scene of
OL,11,Fthe incident at Finger Farm Island near
OL,12,FCastle Donington at about 08:00 BST.
OL,14,FBus operator Trentbarton confirmed the
OL,15,Froad was closed with both of its
OL,16,FSkylink airport services affected.
OL,18,FIt said: "We know this will be
OL,19,Ffrustrating for customers travelling to
OL,20,Fand from the airport, Gateway and
OL,21,Fsurrounding businesses, and we're sorry
OL,22,Ffor the disruption."
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
